+trusted sender. Ordinary forwarding keeps its existing credential behavior.
+The sender must authenticate TLS for the enrolled target, obtain fresh send
+authority, check its send-start deadline at the actual first write, and refuse
+unsupported routes, redirects, retries, and connection reuse.
+
